ery animated frame changes content). Pacing (BENCH_PACING, requested=60): native Flutter cadence = Ticker/SchedulerBinding frames driven by the engine vsync; the Linux GTK embedder registers no vsync callback, so the engine uses its fallback vsync waiter with a fixed 1/60 s tick (engine source shell/common/vsync_waiter_fallback.cc). No public/documented API uncaps it, so uncapped -> pacing \"60-only\". gc = null: Dart exposes no GC counters in AOT release. Warm-up 2 s; script time frozen at 0 during warm-up. nav: Navigator with PageRouteBuilder slide (300 ms) and RawDialogRoute fade (200 ms); script = push B, push C, pop, pop (4 transitions) x5 = 20 per batch, one modal open+close after every cycle; batches repeat until the duration ends. Frames exist only while animating (no idle frames). A background Dart isolate spins an integer loop (~1 core).","unsupported":null}